      "q": "1. Friends are an important part of our lives. Why do you think so? Share your ideas with your friend. What do you do when you are with your friends and how do you feel?\nNow, complete the following sentences by writing in the shapes given below. Share your completed sentences with your classmates and teacher. One has been done for you.",
