      "a": "A New Friendship in the Library\nIn January 2023, I met Riya at our school library. We were paired together for a class project on environmental science. As we worked on the project, we discovered we both enjoyed reading and had a passion for nature. Our collaboration made the project enjoyable and led to many shared conversations about our interests. By the end of the project, we had formed a close friendship, often meeting up to discuss books and plan weekend hikes.\nLet us Explore"
