      "q": "2. Now, write a paragraph of about 100 words, with the title - I am a Kite\nAns.\nI am a vibrant, diamond-shaped kite, adorned in bright yellow with striking red and blue accents. My long, colorful tail sways gracefully in the wind, adding to my beauty and balance. Soaring high above a lush, green field on a sunny day, I am owned by a child who delights in our outdoor adventures. Together, we create joyful memories in the park, where I dance in the sky among friends of various shapes and hues. My message to humanity is simple: embrace the small joys and freedom of life, let your spirit soar, and savor the beauty around you.\nIla Sachani: Embroidering Dreams with her Feet\nLet us do these activities before we read. (Pg 151)",
